@startuml
title Himeros — Bounded Context Map
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

package "Himeros Core" {
  [Identity]
  [Profile]
  [Media]
  [Recommendation]
  [Interaction]
  [Match]
  [Messaging]
  [Trust & Safety]
  [Notification]
  [Billing]
  [Premium]
}

[Identity] --> [Profile] : user identity
[Profile] --> [Recommendation] : profile query
[Trust & Safety] --> [Recommendation] : exclusions
[Interaction] --> [Match] : MutualLikeDetected
[Match] --> [Messaging] : MatchCreated
[Match] ..> [Notification] : event
[Billing] --> [Premium] : PaymentCaptured
[Media] --> [Profile] : photos

note right of [Recommendation]
Candidate retrieval
Eligibility
Ranking
Diversity (future)
end note

note right of [Trust & Safety]
Block
Report
Moderation (future)
Risk / anti-abuse (future)
end note
@enduml
